    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Future projection</strong> is an FPS that combines old-school FPS gameplay with modern graphics, giving you a concise and refreshing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Types Of Unique Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The minigun </strong>can collect enemies' bullets and throw them back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The energy weapon</strong> can interact with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gravity gun</strong> sends incoming bullets back to the heads of the enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/73187fa0a6b21a36c98aaae361409475.poster.avif?t=1727549449\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/73187fa0a6b21a36c98aaae361409475.webm?t=1727549449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the energy weapon to change the environment and use the parkour features to defeat enemies.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles with wall running </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with the environment you've changed with Dash and Glide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/c3c85e76febd79545d630e36c7563541.poster.avif?t=1727549449\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/c3c85e76febd79545d630e36c7563541.webm?t=1727549449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Street Gangs To The Highest Law Enforcement, Everyone Is Against You</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple street gangs</strong> will only bother you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite soldiers</strong> can try to stop you with their advanced weapons and training. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechs and Cyborg ninjas</strong> are your most powerful enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Future projection</strong> is an FPS that combines old-school FPS gameplay with modern graphics, giving you a concise and refreshing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Types Of Unique Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The minigun </strong>can collect enemies' bullets and throw them back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The energy weapon</strong> can interact with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gravity gun</strong> sends incoming bullets back to the heads of the enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/73187fa0a6b21a36c98aaae361409475.poster.avif?t=1727549449\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/73187fa0a6b21a36c98aaae361409475.webm?t=1727549449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the energy weapon to change the environment and use the parkour features to defeat enemies.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles with wall running </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with the environment you've changed with Dash and Glide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211620/extras/c3c85e76febd79545d630e36c7563541.poster.avif?t=1727549449\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/32116